 * MLflow tracing integration for Claude Code.
 *
 * Reads a Claude Code JSONL transcript and emits an MLflow trace shaped as:
 *
 *   AGENT claude_code_conversation
 *   ├─ LLM  llm                 (one per text-only assistant turn)
 *   ├─ TOOL tool_<Name>         (one per tool_use)
 *   └─ TOOL tool_Task           (one per sub-agent invocation)
