 * The pure parsing helpers live in `./transcript.ts` and mirror the Python
 * integration (`mlflow/claude_code/tracing.py`). This module adds the
 * TypeScript-specific span construction plus sub-agent handling (inline
 * `progress` events and separate `subagents/agent-<id>.jsonl` files).
